  "raw_text": "y. Agent: Thank you for that explanation. Now, thinking beyond McDonald's, can you name two or three similar items you also like from any other fast-food chains? And for each of those, could you... User: I don't eat McDonald's. I do not eat any other fast food, just McDonald's. Agent: Understood, you only eat McDonald's. So, sticking with McDonald's, what do you usually pair with your Big Mac? This could be drinks, sides,... User: I get fries and a drink. That's it. Just fries and a drink, no chicken nuggets Agent: Okay, fries and a drink. And what would you never pair your Big Mac with, and why? User: . I can't say never because I like all McDonald's items. So I would get a Big Mac with anything. Agent: I understand you enjoy all McDonald's items and would pair a Big Mac with anything on their menu. Moving on, in what situations do you choose the Big Mac most often? Please consider factors like time... User: I choose the Big Mac whenever I get food from McDonald's whether it's lunch",
